  metaTitle="Upgrade an Existing Fireplace — Gas Inserts, Gas Logs & Doors"
  metaDescription="Convert a wood-burning fireplace to gas, add an insert for real heat, or refresh it with new doors and a mantel. Talk to our team: 718-326-4328."
  eyebrow="Upgrade an existing fireplace"
  title="Make the fireplace you have one you actually use."
  lede="Drafty, dated or just too much work? There are a few good ways to improve an existing fireplace. We will help you see which one fits your opening and what you want from it."
  heroProject="wood-to-gas-fireplace-conversion"
  heroAlt="Existing fireplace converted to gas with a log set and glass doors"
  crumbs={[['Fireplaces', '/fireplaces/']]}
  projectType="existing-fireplace"
  whoFor={[
    'You have a wood-burning fireplace you rarely light.',
    'You want to convert from wood to gas.',
    'You want real heat from the fireplace, not just a fire to look at.',
    'The fireplace works, but the doors, mantel or surround look tired.',
  ]}
  optionsHeading="Start with the choice that matters most"
  optionsIntro="Before brands or models, decide between heat and looks. That one decision narrows everything else."
